i̶a̶ ̶B̶I̶M̶ ̶B̶R̶,̶ ̶e̶x̶c̶e̶p̶c̶i̶o̶n̶a̶l̶m̶e̶n̶t̶e̶,̶ ̶p̶o̶d̶e̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶v̶i̶d̶a̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶e̶s̶p̶e̶c̶i̶a̶l̶i̶s̶t̶a̶s̶,̶ ̶p̶e̶s̶q̶u̶i̶s̶a̶d̶o̶r̶e̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶t̶é̶c̶n̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶ó̶r̶g̶ã̶o̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶ ̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶s̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶p̶r̶i̶v̶a̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶a̶p̶o̶i̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶c̶u̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶a̶t̶i̶v̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶e̶n̶v̶o̶l̶v̶i̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶s̶ ̶g̶r̶u̶p̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶t̶r̶a̶b̶a̶l̶h̶o̶.̶","html":"Ar̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶ ̶ ̶O̶s̶ ̶g̶r̶u̶p̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶t̶r̶a̶b̶a̶l̶h̶o̶:̶<br>\n̶̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶m̶p̶o̶s̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶n̶a̶ ̶f̶o̶r̶m̶a̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶t̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶i̶t̶ê̶ ̶G̶e̶s̶t̶o̶r̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶r̶a̶t̶é̶g̶i̶a̶ ̶B̶I̶M̶ ̶B̶R̶;̶<br>\n̶̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶n̶ã̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶d̶e̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶ ̶m̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶t̶e̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶s̶;̶<br>\n̶̶I̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶r̶á̶t̶e̶r̶ ̶t̶e̶m̶p̶o̶r̶á̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶u̶r̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶n̶ã̶o̶ ̶s̶u̶p̶e̶r̶i̶o̶r̶ ̶a̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶a̶n̶o̶;̶ ̶e̶<br>\n̶̶I̶V̶ ̶-̶ ̶e̶s̶t̶a̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶l̶i̶m̶i̶t̶a̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶a̶ ̶c̶i̶n̶c̶o̶ ̶o̶p̶e̶r̶a̶n̶d̶o̶ ̶s̶i̶m̶u̶l̶t̶a̶n̶e̶a̶m̶e̶n̶t̶e̶.̶<br>\n̶̶P̶a̶r̶á̶g̶r̶a̶f̶o̶ ̶ú̶n̶i̶c̶o̶.̶ ̶ ̶A̶ ̶c̶r̶i̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶G̶r̶u̶p̶o̶ ̶T̶é̶c̶n̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶r̶a̶t̶é̶g̶i̶a̶ ̶B̶I̶M̶ ̶B̶R̶,̶ ̶e̶x̶c̶e̶p̶c̶i̶o̶n̶a̶l̶m̶e̶n̶t̶e̶,̶ ̶p̶o̶d̶e̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶v̶i̶d̶a̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶e̶s̶p̶e̶c̶i̶a̶l̶i̶s̶t̶a̶s̶,̶ ̶p̶e̶s̶q̶u̶i̶s̶a̶d̶o̶r̶e̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶t̶é̶c̶n̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶ó̶r̶g̶ã̶o̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶ ̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶s̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶p̶r̶i̶v̶a̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶a̶p̶o̶i̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶c̶u̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶a̶t̶i̶v̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶e̶n̶v̶o̶l̶v̶i̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶s̶ ̶g̶r̶u̶p̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶t̶r̶a̶b̶a̶l̶h̶o̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"sec-18","kind":"heading","tag":"h4","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶1̶.̶ ̶ ̶O̶s̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶i̶t̶ê̶ ̶G̶e̶s̶t̶o̶r̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶r̶a̶t̶é̶g̶i̶a̶ ̶B̶I̶M̶ ̶B̶R̶,̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶G̶r̶u̶p̶o̶ ̶T̶é̶c̶n̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶r̶a̶t̶é̶g̶i̶a̶ ̶B̶I̶M̶ ̶B̶R̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶g̶r̶u̶p̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶t̶r̶a̶b̶a̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶ ̶e̶n̶c̶o̶n̶t̶r̶a̶r̶e̶m̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶D̶i̶s̶t̶r̶i̶t̶o̶ ̶F̶e̶d̶e̶r̶a̶l̶ ̶s